# The velocity curve: the snare, then the closed hat, at v127, v100, v80, v64, v45 and v28
@length 4bars

1.1      snare 1/16  v127
1.2      snare 1/16  v100
1.3      snare 1/16  v80
1.4      snare 1/16  v64

2.1      snare 1/16  v45
2.2      snare 1/16  v28

3.1      hat-closed  1/16  v127
3.2      hat-closed  1/16  v100
3.3      hat-closed  1/16  v80
3.4      hat-closed  1/16  v64

4.1      hat-closed  1/16  v45
4.2      hat-closed  1/16  v28
